<Layout title="Privacy & Policies" description="How the VALLIS catalogue website handles enquiry drafts, contact details, external links and product information.">
 <PageHero label="PRIVACY & WEBSITE INFORMATION" title="Your information. <em>Handled with care.</em>" description="Information about enquiry drafts, external services and use of this architectural hardware catalogue." crumbs={[{label:'Privacy & Policies'}]} compact/>
 <div class="section"><article class="container policy"><p class="eyebrow">Policy updated · 31 October 2026</p><h2>Enquiry information</h2><p>The enquiry form asks for your name, email address, phone number, product category and project requirements. You may also provide a company name and product or model of interest. These details help us understand and respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>How enquiry drafts work</h2><p>The form prepares a message in your browser. Form values are not sent to a website submission service or saved in browser storage by this website. When you select Open Email Draft, your email application receives the prepared message. You must send the message in that application to contact VALLIS.</p><p>When you send an enquiry, VALLIS receives the details you include and uses them to discuss products, availability, quotations and project requirements. Please do not include sensitive personal information in your message.</p><h2>Catalogue downloads</h2><p>Before a product catalogue opens, we ask for your name, email address and phone number, and optionally your company. These details, with the catalogue you chose and the date, are sent to VALLIS so our team can follow up about your project. They are used only for that purpose and are not sold or shared for advertising. After you complete the form, a session flag containing no personal information is kept in session storage so you are not asked again during the same visit.</p><h2>External services and links</h2><p>Email drafts use your device’s configured email application. Directions links open Google Maps. These external services process information under their own privacy policies. The website does not embed maps or social-media widgets.</p><p>Product-enquiry links can include the chosen product and category in the URL. Please avoid adding personal information to these URLs.</p><h2>Cookies, analytics and browser storage</h2><p>This website does not install analytics or advertising cookies and does not save enquiry information in local storage. Session flags containing no personal information are kept in session storage only to skip the brief loading animation and the catalogue form on later pages of the same visit. Fonts and website imagery are hosted with the site. The hosting provider may process ordinary request information, such as IP addresses and access logs, for site operation and security.</p><h2>Enquiry correspondence and retention</h2><p>Once you send a message through email, the correspondence is held in the relevant communication systems. Enquiry details may be needed to answer your request and maintain related business correspondence. For information about retention of your particular enquiry, contact us at info@vallisglobal.in.</p><h2>Your requests</h2><p>You may contact us to ask about your enquiry information, correct details or request deletion of correspondence, subject to any applicable recordkeeping obligations. We may need enough information to identify the correspondence involved.</p><h2>Catalogue information</h2><p>Product images, models and listed specifications are drawn from supplied catalogue materials. Confirm the model, finish, dimensions, installation suitability and current availability with our team before ordering. Application images are presented as catalogue inspiration and do not establish that the pictured buildings are completed VALLIS projects.</p><p>Some atmospheric interior and detail photographs on this website are illustrative images created for the website. They show hardware types in context and are not completed VALLIS projects or exact catalogue models. Refer to each product page for the genuine catalogue model image and specifications.</p><h2>Policy updates</h2><p>This policy should be reviewed whenever the enquiry process, hosting services or website tracking changes. The date above identifies this prepared version.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>VALLIS (Buildmart India)<br/>A14/15, Golf Course Rd, DLF Phase 1, Gurugram, Haryana 122002<br/>Aspin Commercial Tower, Sheikh Zayed Road, Business Bay, Dubai, UAE · <a href="tel:+971551504568">+971 551504568</a><br/><a class="link-arrow" href="mailto:info@vallisglobal.in">info@vallisglobal.in</a><br/><a class="link-arrow" href="tel:+919990069207">+91 9990069207</a></p></article></div>
</Layout>
